WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Choose the right workspace. Open the workspace profile at the top of the left navigation.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Find your workspace. Search by name, then select the workspace you need.

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Check the current context. Confirm the workspace name and Sandbox environment before continuing.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Sandbox and Live stay separate. Selecting Live does not copy your test records or API keys.

5
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Live requires activation. Contact support to activate Live, or keep using Sandbox.
